 R  EW
 R  U
 R  R
 R  F
 R  G
 R  H
 R  LOGU
 M  EXP
 M  LOG
 L  WGE0

INDIVIDUALS

*   logreg2 = w1 * log u + w2 * ( w + log u )
*   where u = 1 + exp(-w) 

 T  LOGREG
 A  P                   P1 + P2 
 A  WGE0                W .GE. 0.0
 I  WGE0      EW        EXP( - W )
 E  WGE0      EW        EXP( W )
 A  U                   1.0 + EW
 A  R                   EW / U
 A  LOGU                LOG( U )
